# Domain Logic

- **Scope**: Pure computations such as 1RM estimation and volume aggregation.
- **Non-Goals**: I/O, logging, repository access.

## Rules

- Pure functions only; deterministic outputs for identical inputs.
- No imports from services or repositories.
- Include unit tests for all formulae and boundary conditions.

